{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FEATUREMODELEXCHANGEFORMAT_SECTION_6_3_Class_FMFeatureMap","src":"manifest","doc":"FeatureModelExchangeFormat","page":53,"text":"6.3 Class FMFeatureMap\nA FMFeatureMap aggregates a number of FMFeatureMapElements in the role map-\nping.\nClass\nFMFeatureMap\nPackage\nM2::AUTOSARTemplates::FeatureModelTemplate\nNote\nA FMFeatureMap associates FMFeatures with variation points in the AUTOSAR model. To do this, it\ndefines value sets for system constants and postbuild variant criterions that shall be chosen whenever a\ncertain combination of features (and system constants) is encountered.\nTags:atp.recommendedPackage=FMFeatureMaps\nBase\nARElement, ARObject, CollectableElement, Identifiable, MultilanguageReferrable, Packageable\nElement, Referrable\nAggregated by\nARPackage.element\nAttribute\nType\nMult.\nKind\nNote\nmapping\nFMFeatureMapElement\n*\naggr\nSet of mappings defined by this FMFeatureMap.\nTable 6.1: FMFeatureMap","caption":"6.3 Class FMFeatureMap","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FEATUREMODELEXCHANGEFORMAT_SECTION_6_3_Class_FMFeatureMap","releases":["4.1.3"],"page":51,"hash":"a3e398497b49cb6b","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/8c4815f81642/page_51.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FEATUREMODELEXCHANGEFORMAT_SECTION_6_3_Class_FMFeatureMap","releases":["4.2.2"],"page":52,"hash":"11515302c5943ccc","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/83f5320d4fa6/page_52.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FEATUREMODELEXCHANGEFORMAT_SECTION_6_3_Class_FMFeatureMap","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":53,"hash":"eebcaae962b39170","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/949728bb70f7/page_53.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FEATUREMODELEXCHANGEFORMAT_SECTION_6_3_Class_FMFeatureMap","releases":["R19-11"],"page":52,"hash":"70d8176c990e4bd5","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/276d2eb0b701/page_52.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FEATUREMODELEXCHANGEFORMAT_SECTION_6_3_Class_FMFeatureMap","releases":["R20-11"